<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SciMDR</span>: Benchmarking and Advancing Scientific 
<br class="ltx_break">Multimodal Document Reasoning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
