<td id="S2.T1.14.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">ChartQA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">Masry et al. (2022)</a></cite></td>
<td id="S2.T1.14.1.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S2.T1.14.1.10.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0000;">×</span></td>
<td id="S2.T1.14.1.10.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S2.T1.14.1.10.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">human + llms</span></td>
